Chapter: BrowserTheme
  cites UI chapter Theme
  cites Foreword chapter Widget

 The browser's visual theme. Dark chrome with high-contrast
 text. Page content uses a light default that pages can override.
 Trust indicators are color-coded by capability tier.

Section: Chrome Colors

  browser-bg : Integer
  browser-bg = 0x1E1E2E

  browser-chrome-bg : Integer
  browser-chrome-bg = 0x313244

  browser-tab-bg : Integer
  browser-tab-bg = 0x45475A

